""",treatment_done
Pavement Deterioration Paper — Master Pipeline Generator,0
=========================================================,0
Runs the complete experimental pipeline:,0
  1. SA-optimized CLR (K=2..8) via zeke_pavement_jax.py,0
  2. Temporal model comparison (OLS, AR1, RW, NUR),0
  3. Diagnostics (CV, bootstrap CI, DW, permutation importance),0
  4. All plots and LaTeX tables for clean_article.tex,0
,0
Output: paper_results.tex (auto-populated), paper/ subdirectory with all figures.,0
Usage: python master_paper_generator.py [--quick],0
""",0
,0
